          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: In June 1999, a glider pilot was taking landscape photos and noticed unidentified spots on the slides that he had not seen at the time of shooting. He believes they are OVNI. This type of testimony based on photos without visual correlation is generally unusable, as the spots observed could also be reflections at the lens level or spots caused during the development process.",
